doc:Factsamethod_method_1 None:has_text_value "Flight parameter selection method based on dual-domain rough sets and three-way decision theory; introduces regret theory to quantify experts' psychological preferences; constructs a subjective evaluation model integrating psychological and absolute agreement; establishes a subjective-objective conflict information system in a dual-domain framework; designs bidirectional decision rules considering positive-domain and negative-domain conditional probabilities; generates candidate sets of key flight parameters; uses a Bayesian minimum loss criterion to determine the optimal parameter set; reports improved accuracy and robustness while maintaining interpretability" .
_:cac5a2ad6cc5d92e37b74c2e76875b6f rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsamethod_method_1 None:has_text_value "Flight parameter selection method based on dual-domain rough sets and three-way decision theory; introduces regret theory to quantify experts' psychological preferences; constructs a subjective evaluation model integrating psychological and absolute agreement; establishes a subjective-objective conflict information system in a dual-domain framework; designs bidirectional decision rules considering positive-domain and negative-domain conditional probabilities; generates candidate sets of key flight parameters; uses a Bayesian minimum loss criterion to determine the optimal parameter set; reports improved accuracy and robustness while maintaining interpretability" )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:281d68345799 .
